  <description>
    A white hatchback. Copy of the OpenRobotics Fuel model with its material and texture
    renamed, so several colours can be in one world (Gazebo caches materials and textures
    by name, and the Fuel colours all use "Hatchback" / hatchback.png).
  </description>
</model>
